  m_Name: Mortici
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  _name: Mortici
  sentences:
  - FINALLY YOU ARE HERE
  - I was so worried you can't even imagine
  - Sorry I don't know where your wallet is
  - Changing the subject, you look sick as hell is everything ok?
  - Hand streching? What? YOu look hella drunk let's go home
  - Honestly this club is mid, not everything special about it
  - Relax I didn't drink anything tonight, but there is a problem
  - I putted in a crate but some random bouncer just disappeared with it to the bar
  - I know you are sick but trust me I go out of here and get the car and we leave this place ASAP
  - Don't forget Krisio, he's is also missing, last time i saw he was not so sick
